.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "September 2026" "BSDSF23M009-OS-A01" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrlen(const char *" s );
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrlen()
function computes the length of the string pointed to by
.I s,
excluding the terminating null byte ('\\0').
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters in the string.
.SH AUTHOR
Written by Alisha (BSDSF23M009).
